<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 11.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali heads celebrations for Human Rights Day; says no human rights without economic, social and cultural rights.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali hands annual human rights prize to U.N. High Commissioner for Refugees Sadako Ogata.</p>
<p>- Parliament debates 1997 budget draft for second day.</p>
</text>
